{
  "bookId": "rewind-43",
  "id": "chapter-176",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36721001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滴答……滴答……滴答……\n399……398……397……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "你在哪？！克拉拉——克拉拉——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "真乃？！你怎么还在这，快跟我一起出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "彩音，你看到克拉拉了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "克拉拉？！她好像往摩天轮那去了……真乃，你去哪？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我去找她，你快离开这，很危险！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "真乃，喂，你快点回来！笨蛋！你走错路了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这是哪？糟糕……怎么这个时候，迷路了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "地图地图……找到了，游乐园地图！\n上北下南，左西右东，我应该往左走吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滴答……滴答……滴答……\n299……298……297……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "没办法了，朝着摩天轮的方向跑一定能到的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>目标定位成功，启动领航模式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "帕拉斯？！希塔小姐也在附近？！太好了，快带我去找她！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>导航结束，全程用时59秒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呼——希塔小姐，你怎么会在这？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "因为她在这。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "什么？谁？对了，希塔小姐你看见克拉拉了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "她在摩天轮上面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "摩天轮……上面？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "时间不多了，我需要你帮忙去阻止她按下爆炸按钮。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721021",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "什么？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "连环爆炸案的真凶，游乐园爆炸的策划者，骗过所有人的幕后黑手就是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不可能……克拉拉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36721024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不可能是她！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-882",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
