      ],
      "title": "灼眼的夜空·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36725001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "「湛蓝色的晨星，真是让人移不开眼睛呢。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "「真是好奇，你是怎么成长到现在还能保持这样的善良的。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "「女巫说我今天的幸运色是红色……」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "「让她走！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "「Lucky~看来那个女巫很灵嘛。我今天的幸运色，真的是红色呢。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "「选红色，还是蓝色呢？」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滴答……滴答……滴答……\n29……28……27……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "怎么样？决定好了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "蓝色……我选蓝色！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咔嚓——\n滴——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "哎呀，「正义的英雄」成功阻止了危险的反派引爆炸弹，哈哈哈哈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "但是我很好奇，真乃为什么会知道是蓝色的这根线呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……我不知道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "那就是猜对了？啊，没办法，运气好的人真令人讨厌啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不是的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "那是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "因为你就是一个讨厌无聊和重复的人！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "哇哦，我现在确实有些惊讶了。原来真乃已经这么了解我了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "所以到底为什么？为什么……不是说好要一起创造新的回忆吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "答案我已经说腻了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "不过真乃给了我一个惊喜，我也送你一个怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "什么？你想做什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "其实这两个按钮，无论按哪个……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "时间到了都还是会爆炸的哦！！！哈哈哈哈哈！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "9……8……7……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725026",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "听到了吗，底下传来的那些美妙尖叫声，哈哈哈哈——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725028",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "4……3……2……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725029",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咻——嘭！咻咻咻——嘭！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "烟……花……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36725031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "喜欢吗？我特别准备的游乐园烟花秀！哈哈哈哈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-885",
